  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call on the magic of the green dragonflight and gain the following benefits for the duration.</p><p><strong>Healing Presence.</strong> When you move within 5 feet of a creature, you can restore 5d4 Hit Points to it. A creature can regain these Hit Points only once per turn.</p><p><strong>Wings.</strong> If you don’t already have wings, spectral ones sprout from your back. You have a Fly Speed of 60 feet and can hover, and your movement doesn’t provoke Opportunity Attacks.</p>",
